Vendored xterm.js frontend (https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js).

- xterm-6.0.0.js: UMD build (`lib/xterm.js`), exposes `Terminal` on
  globalThis. Loaded via <script> in index.html, not bundled.
- xterm-6.0.0.css: terminal stylesheet, linked from index.html.

To upgrade: `npm pack @xterm/xterm@<ver>` in /tmp, copy lib/xterm.js
and css/xterm.css here under the new version, update the two
references in web/index.html.
